  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HakiElimu 2008-11</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HakiElimu 2008-2011 - HakiElimu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till HakiElimu fokuserar p&#xe5; genomf&#xf6;randet av organisationens   strategiska plan &quot;Citizens for quality basic education and democracy  in Tanznia&quot;. Syftet med programmet &#xe4;r att medborgare i Tanzania ska   vara mer v&#xe4;linformerade, medvetna, delaktiga i p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende diskussioner  samt aktiva med att h&#xe5;lla regeringen ansvarig f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;nskv&#xe4;rda       f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar avseende utbildning och demokrati sker i Tanzania.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support from Sida is core-support to give HakiElimu the           possibility to implement programme activities in the program          &quot;Citizens for quality basic education and democracy in Tanzania&quot;. The key objectives are that ordinary citizens accross Tanzania are better informed, aware, debating and taking action to hold the government    accountable and bring change in education and democracy.</narrative>
  </description>
